  <Document>
    <name>🇸🇬 SG Motorcycle Parking</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Hello, this map roughly contains all motorcycle lots in Singapore. Its meant to help fellow riders find parking nearby, no matter where you are :)<br><br>Owner: <br>@waffleboy (telegram ID)<br><br>Disclaimer: The accuracy of lots is entirely dependent on the individual datasets, and no guarantee of accuracy is provided. No responsibility will be taken for issues arising from use of this map.<br><br>Technical info:<br>The map merges the following sources:<br><br>1. SingaporeBike Parking thread (https://www.singaporebikes.com/topic/18766-sgbikesforum-official-parking-guide/page/86/#comments)<br><br>2. URA Carpark info (https://data.gov.sg/)<br>3. HDB Carpark info (https://data.gov.sg/)]]></description>
